; Urs and Urðr, and how this body integrates sources of unequal attestation.
; Nine digits, low to high: Urs and Urðr descend from different PIE roots (bear against
; turn); Urs shares its root with Ursus, where it actually comes from; Urðr's root IS
; alive in German as `werden`; and in English as `weird` — wyrd, fate, before it meant
; strange; so the similarity is sound only, the same shape as der Mond with the referent
; now being the person asking, and no exception for the author; every item on the list
; carries a column, so nothing is dismissed; the columns genuinely differ across more
; than two tiers, so integration is by lane rather than one shelf; no row's world-claims
; are admitted as facts, axiom-4 held the same way for the Eddas, the archangels and the
; channelled material alike; and four rows sit at tier 1 with named authors and dates,
; which is a real and holdable status — documents attesting themselves.
